  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueTable_en-US
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-US
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 33b257a7da008d64b8a775f3248cafab, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 31636578304
    m_Localized: == Welcome to the TLS Dungeon ==
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36724269056
    m_Localized: Brave adventurer, what is thy name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1105764278272
    m_Localized: What is thy health?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1168343293952
    m_Localized: 'What is thy attack power? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1269203722240
    m_Localized: You are about to enter the terrifying world of the TLS Dungeon.
      Steel thyself and take heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1334706167808
    m_Localized: 'You find yourself at the entrance to a building long forgotten
      by time.

      In their language, the ancients called it ''Toulouse''.

      Taking
      a better look, you realize there are actually two entrances.

      One is
      in front of you, leading to a larger building. Another, down the road, to a
      smaller one.

      Which entrance will you go through?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1630526234624
    m_Localized: Enter the larger building.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1685270290432
    m_Localized: Enter the smaller building.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4195246661632
    m_Localized: 'You enter a small garden. Whatever plants were kept here before
      have been replaced by the reclamation of nature.

      From here, the path
      splits into two roads.

      To your left, a spiral staircase made of steel
      that leads to the roof.

      To your right, an entrance that leads into a
      hallway.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4342588366848
    m_Localized: Go to the staircase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4389954641920
    m_Localized: Go to the hallway
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4436855349248
    m_Localized: 'You decide to try your luck with the smaller building down the
      road.

      It immediately opens up into a small courtyard. Some of the ancients''
      old mechanical chariots lay here, destroyed.

      You see something glowing
      inside one of them, and reach your hand through the broken glass...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4738639716352
    m_Localized: You found a potion!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4758466191360
    m_Localized: 'To proceed, you must pass through a wide hall with a low ceiling.
      But be careful, the stone here is crumbling, and the columns are weak.

      It
      looks like it could fall down at any second. If you''re not careful, the ceiling
      could collapse on top of you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4822467076096
    m_Localized: Sprint through the hall as fast as you can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4855472054272
    m_Localized: Get on all fours and crawl... slowly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4908228009984
    m_Localized: 'You take the staircase and begin to climb the side of the building.

      Suddenly,
      a loud slithering approaches you from above. The sound of hissing and growling
      grows closer, until...

      Slithering downward from the ceiling, a giant
      serpent blocks your path! Its fangs drip with venom, and it looks at you with
      hunger...

      You draw your sword and your shield. Prepare to fight!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5071214469120
    m_Localized: 'The serpent falls with a mighty thud that rattles the rusting,
      decayed iron of the staircase.

      Its limp corpse falls off the side of
      the platform, unblocking your path.

      At the top of the stairs, you find
      yourself at another impasse. A round hallway, overlooking a circular view of
      the bottom of the building.

      Most of the doors here are rusted shut or
      lead to caved in rooms. However, there are two doors you CAN go into.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5181860208640
    m_Localized: Go into the door closest to the top of the stairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5221139865600
    m_Localized: Go into the door at the back of the circular hallway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5416653152256
    m_Localized: 'You step into the hallway.

      The rooms are made of marble
      and glass. Architecture typical of the ancients.

      As you pass by the
      hall, you notice something gleaming behind a desk at the front...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5531702910976
    m_Localized: You found a potion!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5555765633024
    m_Localized: 'Proceeding further, you come into a large courtyard full of discarded
      tables and chairs.

      To your right, there''s a different spiral staircase,
      similar to the one at the entrance. You''re not sure where it leads.

      The
      left path proceeds into a small set of steps that leads to an even larger courtyard.
      An art mural stands there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5646740086784
    m_Localized: Climb the staircase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5684799201280
    m_Localized: Go to the larger courtyard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5727312666624
    m_Localized: 'Big mistake.


      You don''t want to spend any longer under
      the crumbling ceiling than you have to, so you gear up and sprint through the
      hall.

      However, in your recklesness, you trip and bump into one of the
      pillar. Horror overwhelms you as you hear a loud ''crack''!

      It all happens
      so fast. The sight of collapsing stone is the last thing you ever see.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5890886328320
    m_Localized: 'Crawling seems to have saved your life. As soon as you''re out
      of the hall, a stray breeze passes by and tumbles one of the columns.

      You
      wince and recoil at the loud sounds of several tons of stone crumbling down.

      However,
      the more alarming thing is not that sound, but the groaning and snoring you
      hear behind you.

      You thought it was a wall from the other side of the
      hall, but now that you''re in the courtyard you can see it better...

      There''s
      a giant here. It was fast asleep lying on its side, but the sound of the collapsing
      hallway has alerted it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5965096148992
    m_Localized: Hide!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6104103772160
    m_Localized: Face it head on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6140858458112
    m_Localized: You step into a small room tiled with marble and concrete. There's
      some sinks to the left and stalls to the right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6193983512576
    m_Localized: Look for treasure in the sink.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6228431331328
    m_Localized: Look for treasure in the stalls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6263751565312
    m_Localized: 'You step into a wide room full of easels and wooden stools.

      There''s
      quite a bit of rubble you could look under... or you could search the room
      more thoroughly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6322618621952
    m_Localized: Look under the rubble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6374086926336
    m_Localized: Search more thoroughly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6397386285056
    m_Localized: The staircase leads you to a room at the top of the building. It's
      full of strange machines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6456622440448
    m_Localized: Take one of the strange, thin metal rectangles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6497886003200
    m_Localized: Take one of the large metal boxes with glass parts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6537425707008
    m_Localized: 'You take the steps into the larger courtyard.

      Suddenly,
      the sound of flapping wings alerts you. A large shadow obscures the view.

      It''s
      a young dragon! It''s flown in from above, and it sees you as its next prey.

      You
      draw your sword and your shield. Prepare to fight!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6646251118592
    m_Localized: 'With a loud, ear-piercing screech, the Dragon goes limp and falls
      from the sky.

      Its huge body lands on the ground with a thunderous THUD.

      You''ve
      slain the beast. All that remains is to scour the area for treasure.

      There''s
      the mural behind you, but there''s also something that looks like a booth up
      front.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6748755714048
    m_Localized: Scavenge the mural
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6781504839680
    m_Localized: Search the booth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805710168064
    m_Localized: 'You quickly duck into one of the rooms that the courtyard opens
      up into.

      You duck and make yourself small, waiting out the giant''s
      attention.

      Luck is on your side. It eventually gets bored and walks
      away with thunderous footsteps.

      In the meantime, you now find yourself
      in a room full of ancient technology!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6945296605184
    m_Localized: Grab one of the small rectangular boxes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6946965938176
    m_Localized: Grab one of the large rectangular boxes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7017077923840
    m_Localized: 'The giant awakens fully, and looks at you with anger.

      ''You
      wake Ugg!'' It roars, anger dripping from its voice. ''You die!''

      You
      draw your sword and your shield. Prepare to fight!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7189723865088
    m_Localized: 'The giant falls with a mighty thud that rattles the very ground.

      It
      lets out one last groan before all life leaves its body.

      As this happens,
      the treasures it was holding tightly in its fist come loose and fall to the
      ground.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7270510354432
    m_Localized: Grab the gold crown and leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7295986556928
    m_Localized: Grab the silken cape and leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7339250802688
    m_Localized: You stick your hand into the sink and pull out... a golden ring!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7434465697792
    m_Localized: You walk into one of the stalls and find... a backpack full of art
      supplies!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7469647519744
    m_Localized: You rummage through the debris and uncover... a full human skeleton
      made of some kind of plastic! You decide to take it with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7521203904512
    m_Localized: You look harder, and eventually finally get the idea to look up.
      There's a strange contraption hanging from the ceiling! You jump and grab it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7551386116096
    m_Localized: You strip the materials off of the mural, collecting the various
      priceless paints and materials that still remain...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7598341349376
    m_Localized: You hurry into the booth, wary of another dragon attack, and find
      a treasure trove of tools and objects left behind by the ancients!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7673511665664
    m_Localized: You grab one of the smaller pieces of ancient technology. You think
      they used to call it a 'phone'.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7717178564608
    m_Localized: You grab one of the larger pieces of ancient technology. A 'monitor',
      you believe it's called.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7762464464896
    m_Localized: 'As the life leaves your body, you can''t help but wonder why you
      thought this was a good idea.



      Game Over'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7847470424064
    m_Localized: 'You leave the dungeon the same way you came in.

      You bring
      the treasure you found with you. The merchants of your hometown will surely
      pay a fortune for this!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
